screening.possible_transfer_en:
Possible transfers (ideas/methods):
- Map the decidable/undecidable/PSPACE boundary to MPC scheduling constraints and identify polynomial-time tractable subclasses to prefer in compiler/runtime policies;
- Use the complexity classification to drive static-analysis or pre-check tools that detect constraint combinations likely to blow up state space;
- Justify design of online/approximate schedulers (greedy, heuristics, local search, hierarchical scheduling) for MPC runtimes;
- If the reductions are constructive, reuse them to generate hard benchmark instances for stress-testing schedulers.
